  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T11:50:06Z",
  "body": "I'm not even sure that skills are worth supporting in the long run. They were all the rage half a year ago but now it's all in model weights already. They need to be re-measured, optimized and deleted regularly or they just become the context bloat. In fact some people say to avoid angular skills and use MCP only. ",
